## 3. no section lost credit (clone checked out at BASE, CAND=BASE: both monitor runs 64/64)
$ git clone -q --shared .../tameshi-shokunin "$S/lane-base"
$ git -C "$S/lane-base" checkout -q --detach 9962033fd7a75aa2f2847e979dd687a5d28505a1
$ python3 "$R" "$S/lane-base" 9962033fd7a75aa2f2847e979dd687a5d28505a1 "$S/readers.json"
no section lost credit between 9962033f and 9962033f: nothing to re-key
